    "Variable importance is measured as the drop in annualized test Sharpe ratio when one predictor is set to a reference value and the long-short portfolio is rebuilt. For standardized continuous predictors, the reference value is zero, corresponding to the training-sample mean after standardization. For industry dummies, the reference value is set to the test-sample mean.\n",
